{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T06:26:10.332Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"897c90c1b80c3e3bf21a36a6","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ado-sdk-preview-runtime"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Support SDK semantic preview with managed project runtime links"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Installed SDK 2026.10.23 declares previewItemMutations(options: Pick<CommitItemMutationsOptions, pmRoot | transactionId | author | mutations>) at sdk/item-transaction.d.ts:207; it exposes no authoritative-only or managed-runtime exclusion option. Real packed host 2026.10.25 project installation creates a managed SDK symlink under the tracker; semantic preview rejects it with transaction_preview_non_regular_file before preparing a resolution. Global runtime outside the selected tracker is being verified. Do not remove managed links, bypass regular-file guards, or reimplement SDK workspace cloning. Missing capability: SDK-owned semantic preview scoped to authoritative tracker data while preserving managed extension runtime links. Installed public transaction/snapshot/runtime declarations and open upstream issues were searched; no matching open issue found for previewItemMutations symlink, transaction_preview_non_regular_file, or preview extension symlink. The orchestrator verifies and files this upstream."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["sdk-gap"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-27T06:26:10.332Z"},{"op":"add","path":"